property_value: dcterms:description "The PROMOT ontology was built in the context of the \"Performing a Rare Disease-Oriented Master Observational Trial\" initiative (PROMOT initiative).\n\nPROMOT ontology represents three groups of neuromuscular diseases related to the 13 genes the PROMOT Master Observational Trial focuses on:\n \n- Oculopharyngeal Muscular Dystrophy (PABPN1)\n- Congenital Myasthenic Syndromes (CHRNE, DOK7, COLQ, RAPSN, GFPT1, GMPPB)\n- Congenital Myopathies (RYR1, TTN, NEB, MTM1, ACTA1, SELENON)\n\nThis ontology aims to be the conceptual schema for the common data model the PROMOT initiative will use to collect patient data scattered between the different sites involved in the project.\n \nPROMOT initiative has received funding from the Canadian Institutes of Health Research (CIHR), and in partnership with L’Agence Nationale de la Recherche (France), Health Research Board (Dublin, Ireland), Instituto de Salud Carloss III (Spain), IRSC–IG, Swedish Research Council (Sweden), and Swiss National Science Foundation (Switzerland), partners of the European Joint Programme on Rare Diseases (EJP RD)." xsd:string
property_value: dcterms:license https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
property_value: dcterms:title "PROMOT ontology" xsd:string
property_value: owl:versionInfo "2026-09-10" xsd:string
property_value: seeAlso "More about PROMOT initiative at https://www.promotinitiative.com/\n" xsd:string
owl-axioms: Prefix(owl:=<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>)\nPrefix(rdf:=<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>)\nPrefix(xml:=<http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace>)\nPrefix(xsd:=<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>)\nPrefix(rdfs:=<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>)\n\n\nOntology(\nDeclaration(Class(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C25164>))\nDeclaration(Class(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010001>))\nDeclaration(Class(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010003>))\nDeclaration(Class(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010004>))\nDeclaration(Class(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010005>))\nDeclaration(Class(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010006>))\nDeclaration(Class(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010007>))\nDeclaration(Class(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010052>))\nDeclaration(Class(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0032013>))\nDeclaration(Class(<http://snomed.info/id/12894003>))\nDeclaration(Class(<http://snomed.info/id/84100007>))\nDeclaration(ObjectProperty(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_2000005>))\nDeclaration(DataProperty(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000001>))\nDeclaration(DataProperty(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000002>))\nDeclaration(DataProperty(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000003>))\nDeclaration(DataProperty(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000004>))\nDeclaration(DataProperty(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000005>))\nDeclaration(DataProperty(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000006>))\nDeclaration(DataProperty(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000007>))\nDeclaration(DataProperty(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000008>))\nDeclaration(Datatype(xsd:date))\nDeclaration(Datatype(xsd:duration))\nDeclaration(Datatype(xsd:gYear))\n\n############################\n#   Data Properties\n############################\n\n# Data Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000001> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000001>)\n\nDataPropertyDomain(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000001> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010001>)\nDataPropertyRange(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000001> xsd:int)\n\n# Data Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000002> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000002>)\n\nDataPropertyDomain(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000002> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C25164>)\nDataPropertyRange(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000002> xsd:date)\n\n# Data Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000003> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000003>)\n\nDataPropertyDomain(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000003> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010003>)\nDataPropertyRange(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000003> xsd:decimal)\n\n# Data Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000004> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000004>)\n\nDataPropertyDomain(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000004> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010004>)\nDataPropertyRange(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000004> xsd:duration)\n\n# Data Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000005> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000005>)\n\nDataPropertyDomain(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000005> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010005>)\nDataPropertyRange(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000005> xsd:int)\n\n# Data Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000006> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000006>)\n\nDataPropertyDomain(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000006> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010006>)\nDataPropertyRange(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000006> xsd:token)\n\n# Data Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000007> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000007>)\n\nDataPropertyDomain(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000007> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010007>)\nDataPropertyRange(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000007> xsd:gYear)\n\n# Data Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000008> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000008>)\n\nDataPropertyDomain(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000008> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010052>)\nDataPropertyRange(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000008> xsd:boolean)\n\n\n\n############################\n#   Classes\n############################\n\n# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010001> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010001>)\n\nSubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010001> DataSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000001> xsd:int))\nSubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010001> DataSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000005> xsd:int))\n\n# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010003> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010003>)\n\nSubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010003> DataSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000003> xsd:decimal))\n\n# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010004> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010004>)\n\nSubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010004> DataSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000004> xsd:duration))\n\n# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010005> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010005>)\n\nSubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010005> DataSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000005> xsd:int))\n\n# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010006> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010006>)\n\nSubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010006> DataSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000006> xsd:token))\n\n# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010007> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010007>)\n\nSubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010007> DataSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000007> xsd:gYear))\n\n# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010052> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010052>)\n\nSubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0010052> DataSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_3000008> xsd:boolean))\n\n# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0032013> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0032013>)\n\nSubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0032013> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_2000005> ObjectUnionOf(<http://snomed.info/id/12894003> <http://snomed.info/id/84100007>)))\n\n\n)

